{"publicId":"038083a3-5daf-4c31-90dc-d566e50b1735","title":"NVIDIA Cosmos 3 发布四个开源模型检查点，支持多场景交互模拟","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-05T19:35:16.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-05T19:35:16.000Z","digest":"NVIDIA于2026年11月6日发布四个基于Cosmos 3的开源权重检查点，用于生成多传感器同步的交互式世界模拟数据（含天气/光照/时间变化）及驾驶场景、机器人动作预测等。新增检查点包括：Cosmos3-Nano-Transfer-Auto（多视角驾驶数据生成）、Cosmos3-Nano-Sim-Auto（同步摄像头与LiDAR数据流）、Cosmos3-Nano-Sim-Transfer（文本与模拟控制转真实视频）、Cosmos3-Nano-Sim-Bimanual（机器人/摄像头动作视频预测）。所有检查点遵循OpenMDW1.1协议，允许商业与学术用途，可通过官方链接下载技术文档与演示视频。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-05T20:16:28.879Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"NVIDIA Cosmos 3 发布四个开源交互世界模拟模型","latestReport":{"id":"t8mopt6owd0xmgkvbmlny7j9w"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fWtRkKM85on4","title":"NVIDIA Cosmos 3 新增四个开放权重检查点","firstReportAt":"2026-11-05T19:35:16.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"t8mopt6owd0xmgkvbmlny7j9w","title":"NVIDIA Cosmos 3 发布四个开源交互世界模拟模型","summary":"NVIDIA发布四个基于Cosmos 3的开源模型，用于生成多传感器同步的交互式世界模拟数据（含天气/光照/时间变化）。","source":{"name":"Hugging Face Blog","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-05T19:35:16.000Z","selected":true}}],"officialReports":[{"id":"t8mopt6owd0xmgkvbmlny7j9w","title":"NVIDIA Cosmos 3 发布四个开源交互世界模拟模型","summary":"NVIDIA发布四个基于Cosmos 3的开源模型，用于生成多传感器同步的交互式世界模拟数据（含天气/光照/时间变化）。","source":{"name":"Hugging Face Blog","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-05T19:35:16.000Z","selected":true}],"timeline":[{"id":"t8mopt6owd0xmgkvbmlny7j9w","title":"NVIDIA Cosmos 3 发布四个开源交互世界模拟模型","summary":"NVIDIA发布四个基于Cosmos 3的开源模型，用于生成多传感器同步的交互式世界模拟数据（含天气/光照/时间变化）。","source":{"name":"Hugging Face Blog","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-05T19:35:16.000Z","selected":true}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-05T21:00:00.000Z","heat":9.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T22:00:00.000Z","heat":9.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-05T23:00:00.000Z","heat":9.1,"participants":1}